cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the HPV primer scheme (v5), please cite it as below."
title: "HPV Primer Design — v5 (12 high-risk types, lineage-robust tiling-amplicon scheme)"
abstract: >-
  Design project for a whole-genome tiling-amplicon primer scheme covering 12 high-risk HPV
  types (HPV 16/18/31/33/35/39/45/52/56/58/59/66), optimised to be lineage-robust for
  sub-Saharan Africa. Includes the scheme-generation code, the final v5 scheme outputs
  (per-type primer.bed and canonical-accession reference.fasta), and the methods/provenance
  record (inclusivity, specificity, lineage and pool-balance audits, phylogeny).
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-07"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/aduton1000/hpv-primer-design"
keywords:
  - HPV
  - human papillomavirus
  - tiling amplicon
  - primer scheme
  - whole-genome sequencing
  - sub-Saharan Africa
  - Oxford Nanopore
